DESCRIPTION >
    Successful agent and community model usage by caller and creator username,
    from existing events. Sticky flags and the Paid Pollen sum avoid scanning
    generation history on each quest refresh.

TOKEN tinybird_read READ

SCHEMA >
    `user_id` String,
    `owner_username` String,
    `used_agent` AggregateFunction(max, UInt8),
    `used_community_model` AggregateFunction(max, UInt8),
    `community_model_paid_pollen` AggregateFunction(sum, Float64)

ENGINE AggregatingMergeTree
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY user_id, owner_username
